{"seq":2,"slug":"optics-lenses-focus","title":"光学、镜头与对焦","url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/photography/technical-foundations/optics-lenses-focus","wordCount":1450,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"光学-镜头与对焦\">光学、镜头与对焦</h1><p>把一支 50mm 镜头和一支 200mm 镜头对准同一座山，前者把山装进辽阔的天地，后者把山峰压成贴在脸前的庞然大物。两者接收的是同样的光，区别全在于镜头如何把三维世界投影到平面上。曝光决定了有多少光（见 <a href=\"exposure-triangle\">曝光三角</a>），光学决定的是这些光如何成像——视角、虚化、畸变、清晰度，全部由镜头的物理特性写就。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>镜头的本质是一组透镜，把来自被摄物的发散光线重新汇聚到一个平面（成像面）上。三个量描述了它的成像行为：焦距决定视角与放大率，光圈决定进光与景深，对焦决定哪个距离上的物体最清晰。理解它们的耦合关系，是看懂任何一支镜头的钥匙。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  OBJ[被摄物] --&gt; LENS[镜头 焦距 f]&#10;  LENS --&gt; FL[焦距决定视角&lt;br/&gt;短=广角 长=长焦]&#10;  LENS --&gt; AP[光圈决定进光+景深]&#10;  LENS --&gt; FOCUS[对焦面]&#10;  FOCUS --&gt; DOF[景深: 可接受清晰的前后范围]&#10;  AP --&gt; DOF&#10;  FL --&gt; DOF&#10;  DOF --&gt; IMG[成像面 传感器/胶片]\">flowchart TD\n  OBJ[被摄物] --&gt; LENS[镜头 焦距 f]\n  LENS --&gt; FL[焦距决定视角&lt;br/&gt;短=广角 长=长焦]\n  LENS --&gt; AP[光圈决定进光+景深]\n  LENS --&gt; FOCUS[对焦面]\n  FOCUS --&gt; DOF[景深: 可接受清晰的前后范围]\n  AP --&gt; DOF\n  FL --&gt; DOF\n  DOF --&gt; IMG[成像面 传感器/胶片]</pre><p>下表列出常见焦距段及其视角与典型用途，注意视角是按全画幅（36×24mm）计算的。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>焦距段</th>\n<th>大致视角</th>\n<th>视觉特征</th>\n<th>典型题材</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>14–24mm 超广角</td>\n<td>84°–114°</td>\n<td>夸张透视、纵深感强</td>\n<td>风光、建筑、星空</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>35mm</td>\n<td>63°</td>\n<td>接近人眼、环境感</td>\n<td>街头、纪实</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>50mm 标准</td>\n<td>47°</td>\n<td>透视自然、无变形</td>\n<td>人文、通用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>85–135mm 中长焦</td>\n<td>18°–29°</td>\n<td>压缩空间、虚化强</td>\n<td>人像</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>200mm+ 长焦</td>\n<td>&lt;12°</td>\n<td>强压缩、拉近远景</td>\n<td>野生动物、体育</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"焦距-视角与透视压缩\">焦距、视角与透视压缩</h2><p>焦距 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 与传感器尺寸共同决定视角。对一块宽为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 的传感器，水平视角 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 满足：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>w</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta = 2 \\arctan \\frac{w}{2f}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.988em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">arctan</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>焦距越长，视角越窄，远处物体被放得越大。一个常见的误解是「长焦压缩空间」是镜头的光学效应——其实压缩感来自拍摄距离。用长焦拍远景时，你站得远，前后景物相对距离的比例变小，于是显得「贴」在一起；用广角靠近拍，则放大了近大远小的透视。镜头只是改变了你习惯的拍摄距离，从而间接改变了透视。这一点对人像尤其重要：85mm 让人像「立体而不变形」，靠的不是镜头本身，而是它让你退到一个对脸部透视友好的距离。</p>\n<h2 id=\"景深的物理与控制\">景深的物理与控制</h2><p>景深是「看起来足够清晰」的距离范围。它由三个因素决定：光圈、焦距和对焦距离。其近似公式建立在弥散圆（circle of confusion，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>）的概念上——比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 更小的模糊点，人眼分辨不出，于是被视作「清晰」。超焦距 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 是关键中间量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H = \\frac{f^2}{N \\cdot c} + f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是光圈 f 值。把镜头对焦到超焦距处，从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span> 到无穷远都清晰——这是风光摄影榨取最大景深的经典技巧，详见 <a href=\"../genres/landscape-and-architecture\">风光与建筑摄影</a>。反过来，要极浅景深虚化背景，就用大光圈、长焦、近距离三管齐下，这正是人像的常用配方，见 <a href=\"../genres/portrait-and-street\">人像与街头摄影</a>。这里的光圈 f 值与 <a href=\"exposure-triangle\">曝光三角</a> 里控制进光的是同一个量，所以景深和曝光天然耦合：你为浅景深开大光圈，就必须用更快的快门或更低的感光度来平衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"像差与镜头的妥协\">像差与镜头的妥协</h2><p>完美的镜头只存在于理论里。真实镜头受多种像差困扰：球面像差让边缘光线汇聚点偏移、色差让不同波长的光无法聚焦在同一点（表现为高反差边缘的紫绿镶边）、畸变让直线变弯（广角的桶形、长焦的枕形）、暗角让画面四角变暗。镜头设计就是在这些缺陷之间做工程妥协——多片非球面镜、低色散（ED/萤石）镜片、特殊镀膜都是为压制特定像差而生。</p>\n<p>收小光圈通常能改善大多数像差，但收到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f/16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/16</span></span></span></span></span> 以下又会因衍射而损失锐度，所以每支镜头都有一个「最佳光圈」（多在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f/5.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/5.6</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f/8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/8</span></span></span></span></span>）。现代相机还会在机内或 RAW 显影时数字校正畸变、色差和暗角，关于这一校正发生在成像链的哪个环节，见 <a href=\"sensors-raw-color\">传感器、RAW 与色彩</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自动对焦如何工作\">自动对焦如何工作</h2><p>让正确的距离落在弥散圆判据之内，是对焦系统的任务。主流有两条技术路线。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  AF{自动对焦原理} --&gt; PD[相位检测 PDAF]&#10;  AF --&gt; CD[对比度检测 CDAF]&#10;  PD --&gt; PD1[比较两束分光的相位差&lt;br/&gt;直接算出失焦方向与量]&#10;  PD --&gt; PD2[快 适合追焦运动]&#10;  CD --&gt; CD1[来回微调找对比度峰值]&#10;  CD --&gt; CD2[准 但需要试探 较慢]&#10;  PD1 --&gt; HYBRID[现代相机: 片上相位检测&lt;br/&gt;融合两者]&#10;  CD1 --&gt; HYBRID\">graph TD\n  AF{自动对焦原理} --&gt; PD[相位检测 PDAF]\n  AF --&gt; CD[对比度检测 CDAF]\n  PD --&gt; PD1[比较两束分光的相位差&lt;br/&gt;直接算出失焦方向与量]\n  PD --&gt; PD2[快 适合追焦运动]\n  CD --&gt; CD1[来回微调找对比度峰值]\n  CD --&gt; CD2[准 但需要试探 较慢]\n  PD1 --&gt; HYBRID[现代相机: 片上相位检测&lt;br/&gt;融合两者]\n  CD1 --&gt; HYBRID</pre><p>相位检测通过比较分光后两束图像的相位差，一次就能算出该往哪个方向、移动多少，因此适合连续追焦快速运动的主体。对比度检测则反复微调镜头、寻找图像对比度的峰值，更准但需要试探。2026 年的无反相机普遍采用片上相位检测像素，再叠加 AI 主体识别——可以锁定人眼、动物、车辆乃至特定个体的眼睛。这种识别能力让人像与体育摄影的成功率大幅提升，关于它在抓拍中的实战价值，见 <a href=\"../genres/portrait-and-street\">人像与街头摄影</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>镜头把三维世界投影到平面，焦距定视角、光圈定景深、对焦定清晰平面，三者耦合。</li>\n<li>视角公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta = 2\\arctan(w/2f)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">arctan</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 把焦距与传感器尺寸联系起来；「长焦压缩」其实源于拍摄距离而非镜头本身。</li>\n<li>景深由光圈、焦距、对焦距离共同决定；超焦距技巧用于风光最大景深，大光圈+长焦+近距离用于人像浅景深。</li>\n<li>真实镜头受球差、色差、畸变、暗角困扰，存在「最佳光圈」（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f/5.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/5.6</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f/8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/8</span></span></span></span></span>），过小光圈会引入衍射。</li>\n<li>相位检测对焦快、适合追焦，对比度检测准；现代无反融合两者并叠加 AI 主体/眼部识别。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"光学、镜头与对焦","id":"光学-镜头与对焦"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"焦距、视角与透视压缩","id":"焦距-视角与透视压缩"},{"level":2,"text":"景深的物理与控制","id":"景深的物理与控制"},{"level":2,"text":"像差与镜头的妥协","id":"像差与镜头的妥协"},{"level":2,"text":"自动对焦如何工作","id":"自动对焦如何工作"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"曝光三角","url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/photography/technical-foundations/exposure-triangle"},"next":{"title":"传感器、RAW 与色彩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/photography/technical-foundations/sensors-raw-color"}}